==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Mysterious Calamity]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use decently-levelled [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

